# Apex 26 — Cursor entry

- **Rules:** root `AGENTS.md` (canonical); `CLAUDE.md` only imports it. Coordination: AGENTS.md §Coordination; PR lifecycle skill `steward`. Path rules: edit `.claude/rules/*.md`, then `npm run gen` (never hand-edit generated `.mdc` twins).
- **Skills / subagents:** `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md` and `.claude/agents/*.md` (shared). Codex: `.agents/skills/<name>` via `bash tools/env/mirror-skills.sh` — lockstep, never fork. No `.cursor/skills/` or `.cursor/agents/` unless Cursor-only.
- **Route:** deploy/`version.json` → `deploy-research`; pre-push → `verify-agent` (`--base <ref>`); live canvas → `mcp-probe`; host browser → `playwright-official`; bloat → `slim-bloat` / `code-hunter` (focus dead-code). No `mcp-probe` for version.json.
- **MCP:** six servers in `.mcp.json` / `.cursor/mcp.json` (`apex-tools`, `playwright-official`, `chrome-devtools`, `js-debugger`, `apex-lsp`, `browserstack`); plugins → `mcpPluginServerAllowlist`. Catalog does **not** auto-load — `tools/mcp/apex-tools-mcp.sh call`, `tools/mcp/chrome-devtools-mcp.sh`, `probe-mcp.py chrome-start` (CLI-only). Map: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md`.
- **Cursor Cloud:** the launcher picks the model. Namespaces: `cursor*` plus six repo servers after Bootstrap §3; bare `cursor*` only → CLI fallbacks, re-Save when `environment-info` shows nameless `bash` rows. Subscriptions / endings: `.claude/skills/steward/references/vendors.md`.
- **Steward / train / native tools:** lane contract `.claude/skills/steward`. Direct PR tools CreatePullRequest, ManagePullRequest (draft flip, close), EditPullRequestLabels — call directly, never via `get_mcp_tools`. Wait via `subscribe_github_ci` / `subscribe_github_pr` (no gh polling). Draft green → `closing-refs.mjs --pr <n>` + `ship-pr.mjs --pr <n>` (exit 0) → ManagePullRequest `draft:false` → EditPullRequestLabels add `land`. Already-ready → `ready-gate.mjs --pr <n>`. Many PRs carry `land` (train ≤12); never push `train/**` / `train-next/**`. No task_v2 CI-triage. Fence: `owner: cursor:<agent id> until <ISO UTC, ≤4 h ahead>`.
- **Token hygiene:** one skill per task; prefer `__apex` / `verify-track` / `test:tooling-fast` before screenshots or browser groups. Bootstrap: `docs/AGENT-SURFACE.md` §Bootstrap.
